        "approach": "Lemma 5.2 / Prop 5.4: the greedy chain g^t_i = min(g^{t-1}_{i+1} - 1, lambda_i) dominates every chain COORDINATEWISE in every row, hence maximises u^r for all r SIMULTANEOUSLY; since alpha_1+...+alpha_r = u^r - u^0 telescopes, sort(gamma) is the unique dominance maximum of P(W_l). Verified 462/462.",
